{# twig template — Kasko homepage.

   Reuses `templates/layouts/service-landing.html.twig` so the hero,
   quote form, and trust strip match the rest of the site's landing
   pattern. The controller (DefaultController::getHome) supplies the
   hero variables (hero_image, hero_headline, hero_subheading); the
   intro paragraph is folded into the hero's `hero_subheading` slot
   rather than a standalone intro row.

   Overrides applied here:

     service_landing_additional_sections — "A Better Experience" (two
                                           columns: copy + testimonials)
                                           followed by "The KasKo
                                           Difference" (full-width three-
                                           column trust grid).
     service_landing_social_proof        — suppressed; the Google
                                           reviews now appear inside
                                           "A Better Experience"
                                           (`components/testimonials`),
                                           so the shared single-review
                                           block below would duplicate.

   The previous standalone image carousel on the homepage is removed:
   its dock photo is now the full-bleed hero background. #}
{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block page_content %}
    {% embed 'layouts/service-landing.html.twig' %}

        {# Suppress the shared layout's one-review social-proof block —
             reviews now sit in the two-column "A Better Experience"
             section below (via `components/testimonials.html.twig`),
             preserving existing review functionality in a different
             location. #}
        {% block service_landing_social_proof %}{% endblock %}

        {% block service_landing_additional_sections %}

            {# "A Better Experience" — two columns at lg+:
                 Left: section heading + existing homepage copy +
                       project-showcase callout. `col-lg-7` mirrors
                       the hero's text column.
                 Right: testimonials carousel. `col-lg-5` mirrors the
                       hero's quote-form column, so the reviews card
                       sits directly beneath the form above.
                 Columns top-align via `.align-items-start` and stack
                 vertically below lg. The `.fencing-services` wrapper
                 inherits the shared service-landing section padding
                 and horizontal padding, matching other sections. #}
            {# Inline vertical padding pins the two gaps on either
                 side of this section to exactly 64px at every
                 breakpoint, overriding the shared
                 `.fencing-services`'s 4rem/5rem top + 2rem/2.5rem
                 bottom defaults. `padding-top: 4rem` is the gap
                 from the trust bar above (the trust bar contributes
                 no bottom margin). `padding-bottom: 2rem` pairs
                 with the next section's `padding-top: 2rem` to
                 total 4rem = 64px. Horizontal padding (1.25rem)
                 from `.service-landing section` is untouched. #}
            <section class="fencing-services" style="padding-top: 4rem; padding-bottom: 2rem;">
                <div class="row align-items-start">
                    <div class="col-12 col-lg-7 mb-4 mb-lg-0">
                        <h2 class="fencing-section-title">A Better Experience</h2>
                        <div class="heading-accent mb-4"></div>
                        <p>Hiring a contractor shouldn’t mean wondering when they’ll show up, whether they’ll call you back, or what the job is going to cost when it’s finished.</p>
                        <p>At KasKo, we believe good construction starts with good communication. We show up, talk through the work with you, provide a clear quote, and keep you informed as the project moves forward. And when we’re finished, we want the quality of the work to be the reason you call us for the next project.</p>
                        <p>Whether we’re repairing a deck or transforming an outdoor space, we treat each project like something we’re putting our name on—because we are.</p>

                        <div class="bg-light rounded p-3 d-flex align-items-center mb-0">
                            <div class="mr-3 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center rounded-circle bg-primary text-white"
                                 style="width: 42px; height: 42px; flex: 0 0 42px;">
                                <i class="fas fa-camera"></i>
                            </div>

                            <div>
                                Take a look at some of the projects we’ve completed for Middle Georgia homeowners. <a class="text-link text-forest font-weight-bold" href="" data-toggle="modal" data-target="">View our recently completed projects.</a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-12 col-lg-5 home-experience__reviews">
                        {% include 'components/testimonials.html.twig' %}
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            {# "The KasKo Difference" — full-width three-column trust
                 grid. Columns distribute evenly at md+ (`.col-md-4`
                 × 3 = 12), stack vertically below md with `.mb-4
                 .mb-md-0` on columns 1 and 2. Vertical separators
                 preserved via `.border-left` on columns 2 and 3.
                 Icons, titles, and copy are preserved verbatim. #}
            {# Inline vertical padding pins this section's top gap
                 to 2rem; combined with the preceding section's
                 `padding-bottom: 2rem` it produces the full 64px
                 gap between the two sections at every breakpoint.
                 `padding-bottom: 2rem` keeps the section's own
                 bottom gap tight (down from the 2rem/2.5rem
                 default). Horizontal padding (1.25rem) from
                 `.service-landing section` is untouched. #}
            <section class="fencing-services" style="padding-top: 2rem; padding-bottom: 2rem;">
                <h2 class="fencing-section-title">The KasKo Difference</h2>
                <div class="heading-accent mb-4"></div>

                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-4 mb-4 mb-md-0 px-md-4">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-start mb-2">
                            <i class="fa fa-check text-forest mr-3 mt-1 flex-shrink-0"></i>
                            <h4 class="text-primary mb-0">Straightforward Quotes</h4>
                        </div>
                        <p class="mb-0">
                            Know what we're doing and what you're paying for before the work begins.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-md-4 mb-4 mb-md-0 px-md-4 border-left">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-start mb-2">
                            <i class="fa fa-check text-forest mr-3 mt-1 flex-shrink-0"></i>
                            <h4 class="text-primary mb-0">Clear Communication</h4>
                        </div>
                        <p class="mb-0">
                            Questions get answered. Changes get discussed. You're kept informed.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-md-4 px-md-4 border-left">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-start mb-2">
                            <i class="fa fa-check text-forest mr-3 mt-1 flex-shrink-0"></i>
                            <h4 class="text-primary mb-0">Pride in the Work</h4>
                        </div>
                        <p class="mb-0">
                            We want the finished project to earn the next call&mdash;and your recommendation.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

        {% endblock %}

    {% endembed %}
{% endblock %}
